#: ui.py:89
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "摄像机"

#: properties.py:874
msgid "Camera Plate-local X offset from the Initialize anchor (init_plate_local). Editing translates the camera along the Plate-X axis (pure straight-line translation in D-plane local space). Bidirectionally synced with Radial Distance"
msgstr "摄像机相对板局部坐标的 X 偏移（基于初始化锚点 init_plate_local）。编辑会沿板 X 轴平移摄像机（在 D 平面局部空间中为纯直线平移）。与径向距离双向同步"

#: properties.py:889
msgid "Camera Plate-local Y offset from the Initialize anchor (init_plate_local). Plate-Y axis translation. See Delta X"
msgstr "摄像机相对板局部坐标的 Y 偏移（基于初始化锚点 init_plate_local）。沿板 Y 轴平移。参见增量 X"

#: properties.py:902
msgid "Camera Plate-local Z offset from the Initialize anchor (init_plate_local). Plate-Z axis translation (NOT radial — radial movement toward d is the Radial Distance slider). See Delta X"
msgstr "摄像机相对板局部坐标的 Z 偏移（基于初始化锚点 init_plate_local）。沿板 Z 轴平移（非径向——朝向 d 的径向移动由径向距离滑块控制）。参见增量 X"

#: ui.py:121
msgid "Camera Position"
msgstr "摄像机位置"

#: ui.py:33
msgid "Camera Shift Sync"
msgstr "摄像机偏移同步"

#: properties.py:943
msgid "Camera horizontal shift (UI mirror of cam.shift_x with extended drag range)"
msgstr "摄像机水平偏移（cam.shift_x 的界面镜像，拖动范围更大）"

#: properties.py:953
msgid "Camera vertical shift (UI mirror of cam.shift_y with extended drag range)"
msgstr "摄像机垂直偏移（cam.shift_y 的界面镜像，拖动范围更大）"

#: properties.py:695
msgid "Camera world position anchor for Camera Position computations. Initialized to cam.location at Initialize time, rigid-followed by Plate Transform edits. Used by core.compute_init_plate_local as the reference point that, together with plane_origin, defines init_plate_local = plate_rot.inv @ (init_cam_location - plane_origin)"
msgstr "用于摄像机位置计算的摄像机世界位置锚点。初始化时设为 cam.location，之后由板变换编辑刚性跟随。core.compute_init_plate_local 将其用作参考点，与 plane_origin 一起定义 init_plate_local = plate_rot.inv @ (init_cam_location - plane_origin)"

