msgstr "D 平面板叠加层的轮廓厚度（像素）"

#: properties.py:745
msgid "Perpendicular depth from the camera to the D plane target T. Editing this slider dollies the camera along Z (computes move_delta_z so the new camera position has d = target_distance). Conversely, when Move Delta Z dollies the camera, this value auto-syncs to the live d. Initialize ON restores T from this stored value. Independent of cam.dof.focus_distance. Shown as plain Float without unit so the digits don't get truncated"
msgstr "从摄像机到 D 平面目标 T 的垂直深度。编辑此滑块会沿 Z 轴推拉摄像机（计算 move_delta_z，使新摄像机位置满足 d = target_distance）。反之，当移动增量 Z 推拉摄像机时，此值会自动同步为实时的 d。开启初始化时，将根据此存储值恢复 T。与 cam.dof.focus_distance 无关。显示为无单位的纯浮点数，以免数字被截断"

#: ui.py:185
msgid "Plate"
msgstr "板"

#: preferences.py:106
msgid "Plate Defaults (applied on D Plane init / Reset Plate)"
msgstr "板默认值（在初始化 D 平面 / 重置板时应用）"

#: properties.py:854
msgid "Plate Edge Color"
msgstr "板边缘颜色"

#: properties.py:865
msgid "Plate Edge Width"
msgstr "板边缘宽度"

#: properties.py:843
msgid "Plate Fill Color"
msgstr "板填充颜色"

#: properties.py:837
msgid "Plate Settings Expanded"
msgstr "底板设置已展开"

#: ui.py:144
msgid "Plate Transform"
msgstr "底板变换"

#: properties.py:779
msgid "Plate Transform Location: user-editable delta in D-plane LOCAL axes (baked frame). Starts at (0, 0, 0) on every Initialize. Editing translates the D plane and the camera by the same world delta (delta_world = baked_rotation @ delta_local), preserving shift_x/y. The actual world T position is shown as a greyed-out reference underneath"
msgstr "底板变换位置：D 平面 LOCAL 轴上的用户可编辑增量（已烘焙帧）。每次初始化时均从 (0, 0, 0) 开始。编辑会以相同的世界增量平移 D 平面和摄像机（delta_world = baked_rotation @ delta_local），同时保持 shift_x/y 不变。下方以灰色显示实际的世界 T 位置作为参考"

#: properties.py:798
msgid "Plate Transform Rotation: user-editable delta on top of plate_baked_rotation. Starts at (0, 0, 0) on every Initialize. Editing rotates the D plane and the camera (position + rotation) rigidly around T, preserving shift_x/y"
msgstr "底板变换旋转：叠加在 plate_baked_rotation 之上的用户可编辑增量。每次初始化时均从 (0, 0, 0) 开始。编辑会围绕 T 刚性旋转 D 平面和摄像机（位置 + 旋转），同时保持 shift_x/y 不变"

#: operators.py:195
msgid "Plate reset to AddonPreferences defaults"
msgstr "底板已重置为 AddonPreferences 默认值"

#: properties.py:917
#: ui.py:127
msgid "Radial Distance"
msgstr "径向距离"

#: properties.py:917
msgid "Radial distance from D plane center d (=T) to the camera (3D Euclidean length of the Plate-local position vector). Editing scales the camera's Plate-local position along the current d-cam direction so the new |P| equals this value — i.e. moves the camera along the d-cam line. Bidirectionally synced with Delta XYZ. Hard min > 0 to avoid the camera passing through or onto d"
msgstr "从 D 平面中心 d（=T）到摄像机的径向距离（底板局部位置向量的 3D 欧氏长度）。编辑会沿当前 d-cam 方向缩放摄像机的底板局部位置，使新的 |P| 等于该值——即沿 d-cam 连线移动摄像机。与 Delta XYZ 双向同步。硬性最小值 > 0，以防摄像机穿过或落在 d 上"

#: properties.py:798
#: ui.py:157
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "旋转"

