#: properties.py:745
#: ui.py:95
msgid "Target Distance"
msgstr "目标距离"

#: properties.py:671
msgid "Toggle the D plane Initialize state. Turning ON computes T from target_distance along the camera's current shift view direction. Turning OFF clears the linkage (target_distance is kept as the restore seed). Also set automatically by Get Distance from Click and cleared by external camera edits / deactivation. Session-only: never saved into the .blend file."
msgstr "切换 D 平面的初始化状态。开启时根据 target_distance 沿摄像机当前偏移视线方向计算 T。关闭时清除关联（target_distance 保留作为恢复种子）。也会由「单击获取距离」自动设置，并在外部编辑摄像机或停用时清除。仅限当前会话：从不保存到 .blend 文件。"

#: properties.py:837
msgid "UI-only: whether the Plate section is expanded in the N-Panel"
msgstr "仅界面：底板区域是否在 N 面板中展开"

#: properties.py:826
msgid "When ON the plate draws always on top of the scene (no depth test). When OFF the plate is depth-tested against scene objects, so they occlude it where they intersect"
msgstr "开启时底板始终绘制在场景之上（无深度测试）。关闭时底板会与场景物体进行深度测试，因此相交处会被物体遮挡"

#: operators.py:53
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Click a surface in the 3D Viewport to read its perpendicular depth, then write that value into target_distance. Equivalent to editing the Target Distance slider with the picked value: snapshot / UI Delta / Initialize state are NOT touched (no bake). If Initialize is ON, T moves to the new distance; if OFF, only the Live plate size updates. ESC or right-click to cancel."
msgstr "在 3D 视图中单击某个表面以读取其垂直深度，然后将该值写入 target_distance。等同于用拾取到的值编辑目标距离滑块：快照 / UI Delta / 初始化状态均不受影响（不烘焙）。若初始化已开启，T 会移动到新距离；若已关闭，则仅更新实时底板尺寸。按 ESC 或右键取消。"

#: operators.py:52
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Get Distance from Click"
msgstr "单击获取距离"

#: operators.py:209
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Legacy picker (parked): clicks the viewport and takes the hit point as T directly. Not registered; revived alongside Function B."
msgstr "旧版拾取器（已搁置）：单击视图并将命中点直接作为 T。未注册；与功能 B 一同恢复。"

#: operators.py:208
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Pick D Plane from Click (parked)"
msgstr "单击拾取 D 平面（已搁置）"

