msgstr "重新初始化 D 平面"

#: operators.py:151
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Re-bake the D plane at the camera's current position and orientation. plate_baked_rotation is refreshed, plate_rotation / plate_location_delta / move_delta_* are reset to (0,0,0), and target_distance is preserved"
msgstr "在摄像机当前位置和朝向重新烘焙 D 平面。刷新 plate_baked_rotation，将 plate_rotation / plate_location_delta / move_delta_* 重置为 (0,0,0)，并保留 target_distance"

